'''Li'l Eraser Cat''' (ちびゴムネコ ''Chibi Gomu Neko'', '''Chibi Rubber Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Will (Deadly)|Li'l Tank Awakens!]]. It was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Eraser Cat
|image = E 323.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Will (Deadly)|Li'l Tank Awakens!]]
[[Path to +60| Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 2,370¢ - 9,362¢
}}

==Enemy==
Li'l Eraser Cat has lower stats than [[Crazed Tank Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Tank Cat]] and [[Manic Eraser Cat (Enemy)|Manic Eraser Cat]], with the similar attack style of slamming itself to the ground. Unlike those two, however, you are only able to use Special and Rare cats while fighting him. A notable difference that separates himself from his Crazed and Manic counterparts is that he loses his [[Base Destroyer]] ability, but has a faster attack rate in exchange.

